{"nodes": [{"id": "plans_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_handoff_doc", "label": "Phase 1 Slice 1 Handoff", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-02-phase-1-slice-1-HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Banner-superseded: written mid-plan after task 4 of 12, and everything it says about where execution stopped is now false. Kept rather than deleted because it is the only committed record of tasks 1-4's reasoning and review findings \u2014 the live ledger lives in the gitignored .superpowers/sdd/."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_handoff_mechanism_claiming_tests", "label": "Tests That Claim a Mechanism", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-02-phase-1-slice-1-HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A test whose name claims a mechanism and whose body asserts an outcome that holds anyway. a_closed_cube_measures_its_bbox_and_volume passed with vertex quantisation entirely defeated, because the plan's cube fixture shares literal float values across facets in a way real STL never does. For any test naming a mechanism, ask what mutation would break the mechanism and confirm the test fails under it."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_handoff_migration_rebuild_gap", "label": "Migration Rebuild Gap", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-02-phase-1-slice-1-HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "cargo does not rebuild the test binary when only a .sql migration changes, so sqlx::migrate!'s embedded migrations go stale and you get a green run against the old schema. Hit twice independently. A five-line build.rs emitting cargo:rerun-if-changed=migrations fixes it; harmless in CI, but it will bite the next slice's first migration."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_handoff_storedblob_duplication", "label": "Deliberate StoredBlob Duplication", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-02-phase-1-slice-1-HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "StoredBlob in lapidary-storage and StoredBlobRow in lapidary-db are duplicated on purpose: both are L1 and check-layers forbids L1 to L1 dependencies, so the api layer converts. Recorded explicitly so a later reader does not 'fix' it."}], "edges": [{"source": "plans_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_handoff_doc", "target": "plans_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_ingest_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-02-phase-1-slice-1-HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_handoff_doc", "target": "plans_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_handoff_mechanism_claiming_tests", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-02-phase-1-slice-1-HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_handoff_doc", "target": "plans_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_handoff_migration_rebuild_gap", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-02-phase-1-slice-1-HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_handoff_storedblob_duplication", "target": "plans_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_ingest_blob_cas", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-02-phase-1-slice-1-HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_hand